<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch June producer prices rise 2.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Dutch June producer prices rise 2.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch producer price index (PPI) for manufactured goods fell a provisional 0.6 percent in June from May, giving a 2.7 percent rise year-on-year, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said.  </p>
<p> DUTCH PRODUCER PRICES	  June 97     May 97    June 96</p>
<p> Index (base 1990)		104.4	105.0	101.7</p>
<p> Month-on-month pct change     -0.6	  0.8	 -0.5</p>
<p> Year-on-year pct change	  2.7	  2.7	  0.9</p>
<p> Subindex domestic prices     107.7	108.3	105.8</p>
<p> Subindex export prices	 101.8	102.4	 98.5</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
